@startuml
!theme cyborg
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontColor #F3F4F6
skinparam ArrowColor #CBD5E1
skinparam shadowing false
title Accessibility Review and Evidence
start
:Identify complete journey, actor and candidate;
:Select applicable criteria and recorded client / input matrix;
:Review semantics, labels and component states;
:Run automated checks plus manual keyboard, focus,
assistive technology, contrast and reflow checks;
:Exercise validation, dialogs, dynamic feedback
and protected / denied / pending states;
if (Defect or incomplete coverage?) then (yes)
 :Record criterion, reproduction and user impact;
 :Fix owning component / screen and retest affected journeys;
else (no)
 :Record supported result with scope and limitations;
endif
:Link actual evidence and remaining gaps to RTM;
:Assess PDF / media separately where applicable;
stop
@enduml
